OL,3,GNEWSAFormer eye hospital to be
OL,4,Ademolished as new homes proposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former city hospital will be
OL,7,Fdemolished to make way for a potential
OL,8,Fhousing development.
OL,10,FSunderland Eye Infirmary, on Queen
OL,11,FAlexandra Road, has been empty since
OL,12,Fservices moved to the city's new #50m
OL,13,FSpecialist Eye Hospital in the summer.
OL,15,FThe disused building dates back to the
OL,16,F1940s and work to decommission it was
OL,17,Fcompleted in August.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
