OL,3,GNEWSAFormer eye hospital to be
OL,4,Ademolished as new homes proposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSunderland City Council has now
OL,7,Fapproved plans to flatten it,
OL,8,Fpotentially making way for 62 homes.
OL,9,FHousebuilder Story Homes is behind the
OL,10,Fproposals. A council report confirmed
OL,11,Fnearby residents, businesses and ward
OL,12,Fcouncillors would be contacted before
OL,13,Fdemolition begins.
